# Hallow's Eve pack - item names and descriptions. The game prepends the file name, so each key
# loads as items.<key>, the key an item's TranslationProperties names (items.Hallows_Eve_Jack_Lantern.name).
Hallows_Eve_Lantern_Bomb_Common.name = Lantern Bomb
Hallows_Eve_Lantern_Bomb_Common.description = A carved pumpkin packed with Boom Powder. Throw it at whatever is coming for you.
Hallows_Eve_Lantern_Bomb_Uncommon.name = Burning Lantern Bomb
Hallows_Eve_Lantern_Bomb_Uncommon.description = Essence of Fire in the powder, so whatever the blast catches keeps burning a while.
Hallows_Eve_Lantern_Bomb_Rare.name = Spectral Lantern Bomb
Hallows_Eve_Lantern_Bomb_Rare.description = Ectoplasm in the powder. The blast burns, and the chill it leaves slows anything caught in it.
Hallows_Eve_Lantern_Bomb_Epic.name = Shattering Lantern Bomb
Hallows_Eve_Lantern_Bomb_Epic.description = Packed around a Cursed Geode. It burns and chills like the others, then throws flaming shards in every direction.
Hallows_Eve_Jack_Helm.name = Jack Helm
Hallows_Eve_Jack_Helm.description = A pumpkin rind hollowed out to fit a head, with a candle behind the grin. Part of the Hallowed set: wear it with the Jack Shield in your off hand.
Hallows_Eve_Jack_Helm.description_hallowed_set = A pumpkin rind hollowed out to fit a head, with a candle behind the grin. Part of the Hallowed set: wear it with the Jack Shield in your off hand, and add the Horseman's breastplate, gauntlets and greaves for more.
Hallows_Eve_Jack_Shield.name = Jack Shield
Hallows_Eve_Jack_Shield.description = A wooden shield faced with a carved pumpkin that never stops glowing. Part of the Hallowed set: carry it in your off hand while you wear the Jack Helm.
Hallows_Eve_Jack_Shield.description_hallowed_set = A wooden shield faced with a carved pumpkin that never stops glowing. Part of the Hallowed set: carry it in your off hand while you wear the Jack Helm, and add the Horseman's breastplate, gauntlets and greaves for more.
Hallows_Eve_Burning_Jack_Helm.name = Burning Jack Helm
Hallows_Eve_Burning_Jack_Helm.description = A Jack Helm charred black, with embers still glowing in the cracks. It takes a hit better than the plain one, and fire bites less. Part of the Hallowed set: wear it with a Jack Shield or a Flaming Jack Shield in your off hand.
Hallows_Eve_Burning_Jack_Helm.description_flaming_set = A Jack Helm charred black, with embers still glowing in the cracks. It takes a hit better than the plain one, and fire bites less. Part of the Hallowed set: wear it with a Jack Shield or a Flaming Jack Shield in your off hand. With the Horseman's flaming armour and a Flaming Jack Shield, it also makes the Flaming Hallowed set.
Hallows_Eve_Flaming_Jack_Shield.name = Flaming Jack Shield
Hallows_Eve_Flaming_Jack_Shield.description = A Jack Shield charred black, its carved face burning like a coal. It holds a guard for less stamina than the plain one. Part of the Hallowed set: carry it in your off hand while you wear a Jack Helm or a Burning Jack Helm.
Hallows_Eve_Flaming_Jack_Shield.description_flaming_set = A Jack Shield charred black, its carved face burning like a coal. It holds a guard for less stamina than the plain one. Part of the Hallowed set: carry it in your off hand while you wear a Jack Helm or a Burning Jack Helm. With a Burning Jack Helm and the Horseman's flaming armour, it also makes the Flaming Hallowed set.
Hallows_Eve_Jack_Lantern.name = Jack Lantern
Hallows_Eve_Jack_Lantern.description = A carved pumpkin with a candle inside. Old Jack wants one on every doorstep.
Hallows_Eve_Hollow_Lantern.name = Hollow Lantern
Hallows_Eve_Hollow_Lantern.description = A pale lantern Old Jack gives to whoever sees his errands through. Each Hallow's Eve has its own.
Hallows_Eve_Horseman_Ember.name = The Horseman's Ember
Hallows_Eve_Horseman_Ember.description = A coal from the Headless Horseman's own fire, and it never cools. Old Jack wants it for your Hollow Lantern.
Hallows_Eve_Grave_Candle.name = Grave Candle
Hallows_Eve_Grave_Candle.description = A black candle the Gravekeeper burns to open the gate to the Headless Horseman's graveyard, and the gate stays open for your whole party. Old Jack sells them at his shop once he counts you a Regular, and the Horseman's Boss Kill Claim gives some back.
Hallows_Eve_Burning_Grave_Candle.name = Burning Grave Candle
Hallows_Eve_Burning_Grave_Candle.description = Black candles that never stop burning. The Gravekeeper burns one to open the gate for the Headless Horseman's hard ride, and the gate stays open for your whole party. Old Jack sells them at his shop once he counts you a Regular, for less once you're Trusted with him, and trades one for ten Grave Candles.
Hallows_Eve_Fire_Resistance_Potion.name = Fire Resistance Potion
Hallows_Eve_Fire_Resistance_Potion.description = Grants:\n\n• <color is="#ffffff">Fire Resistance</color>: <color is="#ffffff">35%</color> less fire damage\n\nDuration: <color is="#ffffff">3:00</color>\n\n<i>It tastes of smoke and burnt pumpkin.</i>
Hallows_Eve_Eternal_Candle.name = Eternal Candle
Hallows_Eve_Eternal_Candle.description = A candle that never burns down. Carry it and the Gravekeeper opens the Headless Horseman's graveyard for your whole party without burning a Grave Candle, and you keep it. The hard ride still takes a Burning Grave Candle. Old Jack buys a spare one at his shop.
Hallows_Eve_Ecto_Lantern.name = Ecto Lantern
Hallows_Eve_Ecto_Lantern.description = A pumpkin lit by Ectoplasm. The green light holds steady in any wind.
Hallows_Eve_Costume_Wand.name = Costume Wand
Hallows_Eve_Costume_Wand.description = Point it at a friend. One button turns them into a Jack Skeleton, the other into a Lost Soul, and they can take the costume off whenever they like.
Hallows_Eve_Cursed_Geode.name = Cursed Geode
Hallows_Eve_Cursed_Geode.description = A lump of stone with something bright moving inside. During Hallow's Eve they turn up in broken stone, ore most of all. Hold it and right-click to crack it open, and keep whatever falls out.
Hallows_Eve_Ectoplasm.name = Ectoplasm
Hallows_Eve_Ectoplasm.description = What a Lost Soul leaves behind. It is cold to the touch, and carvers burn it in lanterns.
Hallows_Eve_Hallowed_Pumpkin.name = Hallowed Pumpkin
Hallows_Eve_Hallowed_Pumpkin.description = A violet pumpkin with gold in its ribs. During Hallow's Eve, one turns up now and then when you pick pumpkins by hand, and Jack Skeletons and Pumpkin Fiends drop them. Old Jack wants them for his lanterns.
Hallows_Eve_Carving_Bench.name = Carving Bench
Hallows_Eve_Carving_Bench.description = A workbench set up for pumpkin carving. Stand at it with the makings in your bag and carve.
Hallows_Eve_Carving_Bench.hint = Press [{key}] to carve
Hallows_Eve_Horseman_Breastplate.name = Horseman's Breastplate
Hallows_Eve_Horseman_Breastplate.description = Black steel the Headless Horseman rode in, still warm from his fire. Anything you set alight burns hotter while you wear it. Part of the Hallowed set, with a Jack Helm or the Horseman's Helm, the rest of his armour and a Jack Shield in your off hand. Found now and then in his Boss Kill Claim.
Hallows_Eve_Horseman_Gauntlets.name = Horseman's Gauntlets
Hallows_Eve_Horseman_Gauntlets.description = The gloves that carried the Horseman's lantern. Anything you set alight burns hotter while you wear them. Part of the Hallowed set, with a Jack Helm or the Horseman's Helm, the rest of his armour and a Jack Shield in your off hand. Found now and then in his Boss Kill Claim.
Hallows_Eve_Horseman_Greaves.name = Horseman's Greaves
Hallows_Eve_Horseman_Greaves.description = Black steel from the Horseman's saddle, scorched at the knees. Anything you set alight burns hotter while you wear them. Part of the Hallowed set, with a Jack Helm or the Horseman's Helm, the rest of his armour and a Jack Shield in your off hand. Found now and then in his Boss Kill Claim.
Hallows_Eve_Horseman_Helm.name = Horseman's Helm
Hallows_Eve_Horseman_Helm.description = The Horseman's own helm, from back when he had a head to put in it. Anything you set alight burns hotter while you wear it. Part of the Hallowed set, with the rest of his armour and a Jack Shield in your off hand. Found now and then in his Boss Kill Claim.
Hallows_Eve_Flaming_Horseman_Breastplate.name = Flaming Horseman's Breastplate
Hallows_Eve_Flaming_Horseman_Breastplate.description = The Horseman's breastplate, with his fire still burning in it. Fire bites less while you wear it, and anything you set alight burns hotter. Part of the Hallowed set, and of the Flaming Hallowed set with a Burning Jack Helm or the Flaming Horseman's Helm, the rest of his flaming armour and a Flaming Jack Shield in your off hand. Found only in his Boss Kill Claim on the hard ride.
Hallows_Eve_Flaming_Horseman_Gauntlets.name = Flaming Horseman's Gauntlets
Hallows_Eve_Flaming_Horseman_Gauntlets.description = The gloves that carried the Horseman's lantern, still burning at the fingers. Fire bites less while you wear them, and anything you set alight burns hotter. Part of the Hallowed set, and of the Flaming Hallowed set with a Burning Jack Helm or the Flaming Horseman's Helm, the rest of his flaming armour and a Flaming Jack Shield in your off hand. Found only in his Boss Kill Claim on the hard ride.
Hallows_Eve_Flaming_Horseman_Greaves.name = Flaming Horseman's Greaves
Hallows_Eve_Flaming_Horseman_Greaves.description = Black steel from the Horseman's saddle, still burning at the knees. Fire bites less while you wear them, and anything you set alight burns hotter. Part of the Hallowed set, and of the Flaming Hallowed set with a Burning Jack Helm or the Flaming Horseman's Helm, the rest of his flaming armour and a Flaming Jack Shield in your off hand. Found only in his Boss Kill Claim on the hard ride.
Hallows_Eve_Flaming_Horseman_Helm.name = Flaming Horseman's Helm
Hallows_Eve_Flaming_Horseman_Helm.description = The Horseman's helm, with his fire still burning behind the grin. Fire bites less while you wear it, and anything you set alight burns hotter. Part of the Hallowed set, and of the Flaming Hallowed set with the rest of his flaming armour and a Flaming Jack Shield in your off hand. Found only in his Boss Kill Claim on the hard ride.
Hallows_Eve_Horsemans_Reins.name = Horseman's Reins
Hallows_Eve_Horsemans_Reins.description = The Headless Horseman's own reins, and his black horse is yours with them. Hold the reins and right-click to open your roster, then press Summon to call your horse. Walk up to it and press F to ride. Only you can ride it. Press Dismiss when you're done, and it waits in your roster until you call it again. Old Jack buys a spare pair at his shop.
Hallows_Eve_Horsemans_Reins.command_calm = Calm
Hallows_Eve_Horsemans_Steed_Trophy.name = Horseman's Steed Trophy
Hallows_Eve_Horsemans_Steed_Trophy.description = A tiny figure of the Headless Horseman's black horse in its barding, on a gold-trimmed stand. Place it anywhere you like. Found once in a while in his Boss Kill Claim, and Old Jack sells one.

# Harvest Feast - the year's keepsake, handed over with The Feast's pay.
Harvest_Feast_Golden_Plate.name = Martha's Golden Plate
Harvest_Feast_Golden_Plate.description = A golden plate with the year on it, much too good to eat off. Martha gives one to everyone who sits down to The Feast with her, once each Harvest Feast. Place it anywhere you like, or stack one year's on another.

# Harvest Feast - a rare find from hunting Wild Turkeys.
Harvest_Feast_Turkey_Trophy.name = Turkey Trophy
Harvest_Feast_Turkey_Trophy.description = A turkey that stays where you put it. Once in a long while a Wild Turkey leaves one behind, and only while Harvest Feast runs. Place it anywhere you like.

# Harvest Feast - the price of the Turkey Graveyard, paid for each Extra Turkeys.
Harvest_Feast_Wishbone.name = Wishbone
Harvest_Feast_Wishbone.description = A turkey's wishbone, saved from the roast. <b>Bram the Shepherd</b> in the Forgotten Temple takes one to lead you and your party into the <b>Turkey Graveyard</b> while Harvest Feast runs.\n\nMartha gives you one each time you hand in <b>Extra Turkeys</b>.

# Harvest Feast - the Harvest Set, sold at Martha's shop.
Harvest_Feast_Harvest_Hat.name = Harvest Hat
Harvest_Feast_Harvest_Hat.description = A warm wool hat for long days in the fields. Martha sells it at her shop once she counts you a Friend. Part of the Harvest Set: wear more of it for more health, and the whole set to earn her favor faster.
Harvest_Feast_Harvest_Tunic.name = Harvest Tunic
Harvest_Feast_Harvest_Tunic.description = A wool tunic for long days in the fields. Martha sells it at her shop once you're Head of the Table with her. Part of the Harvest Set: wear more of it for more health, and the whole set to earn her favor faster.
Harvest_Feast_Harvest_Gloves.name = Harvest Gloves
Harvest_Feast_Harvest_Gloves.description = Warm wool gloves for picking in the cold. Martha sells them at her shop once she counts you a Neighbor. Part of the Harvest Set: wear more of it for more health, and the whole set to earn her favor faster.
Harvest_Feast_Harvest_Trousers.name = Harvest Trousers
Harvest_Feast_Harvest_Trousers.description = Wool trousers that stand up to a day in the fields. Martha sells them at her shop once she counts you Family. Part of the Harvest Set: wear more of it for more health, and the whole set to earn her favor faster.

# Harvest Feast - Martha's three dishes, the recipe pages her shop sells for them, and what eating them does.
Harvest_Feast_Turkey_Pie.name = Turkey Pie
Harvest_Feast_Turkey_Pie.description = Martha's own meat pie. Instantly restores <color is="#ffffff">5%</color> health and grants:\n\n• <color is="#ffffff">Health Regen III</color>\n• <color is="#ffffff">Health Boost IV</color>: <color is="#ffffff">20%</color> more max health and <color is="#ffffff">8%</color> less physical and projectile damage\n\nDuration: <color is="#ffffff">10:00</color>\n\nBake it at a Chef's Stove once you've learned Martha's recipe.
Harvest_Feast_Harvest_Salad.name = Harvest Salad
Harvest_Feast_Harvest_Salad.description = Carrots, corn and pumpkin with a pinch of spice. Instantly restores <color is="#ffffff">5%</color> health and grants:\n\n• <color is="#ffffff">Health Regen III</color>\n• <color is="#ffffff">Stamina Boost IV</color>: <color is="#ffffff">40%</color> more max stamina\n\nDuration: <color is="#ffffff">10:00</color>\n\nMake it at a Chef's Stove once you've learned Martha's recipe.
Harvest_Feast_Marthas_Roast.name = Martha's Roast
Harvest_Feast_Marthas_Roast.description = Martha's best dish, meat and vegetables roasted on a stick. Instantly restores <color is="#ffffff">5%</color> health and grants:\n\n• <color is="#ffffff">Health Regen III</color>\n• <color is="#ffffff">Health Boost IV</color>: <color is="#ffffff">20%</color> more max health and <color is="#ffffff">8%</color> less physical and projectile damage\n• <color is="#ffffff">Stamina Boost IV</color>: <color is="#ffffff">40%</color> more max stamina\n• <color is="#ffffff">Favor Boost</color>: Martha's favor comes <color is="#ffffff">10%</color> faster\n\nDuration: <color is="#ffffff">10:00</color>\n\nCook it at a Chef's Stove once you've learned Martha's recipe.
Harvest_Feast_Recipe_Turkey_Pie.name = Recipe: Turkey Pie
Harvest_Feast_Recipe_Turkey_Pie.description = Teaches the <item is="Harvest_Feast_Turkey_Pie"/> recipe. Bake it at a Chef's Stove from dough, raw meat and spices.\n\nInstantly restores <color is="#ffffff">5%</color> health and grants:\n\n• <color is="#ffffff">Health Regen III</color>\n• <color is="#ffffff">Health Boost IV</color>\n\nDuration: <color is="#ffffff">10:00</color>
Harvest_Feast_Recipe_Harvest_Salad.name = Recipe: Harvest Salad
Harvest_Feast_Recipe_Harvest_Salad.description = Teaches the <item is="Harvest_Feast_Harvest_Salad"/> recipe. Make it at a Chef's Stove from carrots, corn, a pumpkin and spices.\n\nInstantly restores <color is="#ffffff">5%</color> health and grants:\n\n• <color is="#ffffff">Health Regen III</color>\n• <color is="#ffffff">Stamina Boost IV</color>\n\nDuration: <color is="#ffffff">10:00</color>
Harvest_Feast_Recipe_Marthas_Roast.name = Recipe: Martha's Roast
Harvest_Feast_Recipe_Marthas_Roast.description = Teaches the <item is="Harvest_Feast_Marthas_Roast"/> recipe. Cook it at a Chef's Stove from a stick, raw meat, a carrot, corn, a pumpkin and spices.\n\nInstantly restores <color is="#ffffff">5%</color> health and grants:\n\n• <color is="#ffffff">Health Regen III</color>\n• <color is="#ffffff">Health Boost IV</color>\n• <color is="#ffffff">Stamina Boost IV</color>\n• <color is="#ffffff">Favor Boost</color>\n\nDuration: <color is="#ffffff">10:00</color>
effect.harvest_feast_food_regen.name = Health Regen III
effect.harvest_feast_food_health.name = Health Boost IV
effect.harvest_feast_food_stamina.name = Stamina Boost IV
effect.harvest_feast_food_favor.name = Favor Boost

# Christmas - the Christmas Set, sold at Elsie the Weaver's Christmas stall.
Christmas_Hat.name = Christmas Hat
Christmas_Hat.description = A cozy cotton hat to keep your ears warm. Elsie the Weaver sells it at her Christmas stall in the Forgotten Temple once Santa counts you Nice. Part of the Christmas Set: every piece earns Santa's favor a little faster and keeps out a little cold, and the more of the set you wear, the more health you get.
Christmas_Coat.name = Christmas Coat
Christmas_Coat.description = A thick cotton coat for the coldest night of the year. Elsie the Weaver sells it at her Christmas stall in the Forgotten Temple once you're Santa's Favorite. Part of the Christmas Set: every piece earns Santa's favor a little faster and keeps out a little cold, and the more of the set you wear, the more health you get.
Christmas_Gloves.name = Christmas Gloves
Christmas_Gloves.description = Soft cotton gloves for building snowmen. Elsie the Weaver sells them at her Christmas stall in the Forgotten Temple once you're On the List with Santa. Part of the Christmas Set: every piece earns Santa's favor a little faster and keeps out a little cold, and the more of the set you wear, the more health you get.
Christmas_Trousers.name = Christmas Trousers
Christmas_Trousers.description = Warm cotton trousers that keep the snow out. Elsie the Weaver sells them at her Christmas stall in the Forgotten Temple once Santa counts you Very Nice. Part of the Christmas Set: every piece earns Santa's favor a little faster and keeps out a little cold, and the more of the set you wear, the more health you get.

# Christmas - the three Christmas treats, their recipe pages, and what eating them does.
Christmas_Gingerbread_Cookie.name = Gingerbread Cookie
Christmas_Gingerbread_Cookie.description = A little gingerbread man with a spicy bite. Instantly restores <color is="#ffffff">5%</color> health and grants:\n\n• <color is="#ffffff">Swift Feet</color>: you move <color is="#ffffff">15%</color> faster\n\nDuration: <color is="#ffffff">10:00</color>\n\nBake them at a Chef's Stove once you've learned the recipe.
Christmas_Hot_Cocoa.name = Hot Cocoa
Christmas_Hot_Cocoa.description = A warm mug of cocoa, sweet and spiced. Instantly restores <color is="#ffffff">5%</color> health and grants:\n\n• <color is="#ffffff">Health Regen III</color>\n• <color is="#ffffff">Warm Inside</color>: <color is="#ffffff">40%</color> less ice damage\n\nDuration: <color is="#ffffff">10:00</color>\n\nMake it at a Chef's Stove once you've learned the recipe.
Christmas_Cake.name = Christmas Cake
Christmas_Cake.description = A rolled sponge cake with a sweet swirl inside. Instantly restores <color is="#ffffff">5%</color> health and grants:\n\n• <color is="#ffffff">Health Regen III</color>\n• <color is="#ffffff">Swift Feet</color>: you move <color is="#ffffff">15%</color> faster\n• <color is="#ffffff">Warm Inside</color>: <color is="#ffffff">40%</color> less ice damage\n• <color is="#ffffff">Nice List Boost</color>: Santa's favor comes <color is="#ffffff">10%</color> faster\n\nDuration: <color is="#ffffff">10:00</color>\n\nBake it at a Chef's Stove once you've learned the recipe.
Christmas_Recipe_Gingerbread_Cookie.name = Recipe: Gingerbread Cookie
Christmas_Recipe_Gingerbread_Cookie.description = Teaches the <item is="Christmas_Gingerbread_Cookie"/> recipe. Bake them at a Chef's Stove from dough and spices, <color is="#ffffff">3</color> at a time.\n\nInstantly restores <color is="#ffffff">5%</color> health and grants:\n\n• <color is="#ffffff">Swift Feet</color>\n\nDuration: <color is="#ffffff">10:00</color>
Christmas_Recipe_Hot_Cocoa.name = Recipe: Hot Cocoa
Christmas_Recipe_Hot_Cocoa.description = Teaches the <item is="Christmas_Hot_Cocoa"/> recipe. Make it at a Chef's Stove from a tankard of water, tree sap and spices, and you keep the tankard.\n\nInstantly restores <color is="#ffffff">5%</color> health and grants:\n\n• <color is="#ffffff">Health Regen III</color>\n• <color is="#ffffff">Warm Inside</color>\n\nDuration: <color is="#ffffff">10:00</color>
Christmas_Recipe_Cake.name = Recipe: Christmas Cake
Christmas_Recipe_Cake.description = Teaches the <item is="Christmas_Cake"/> recipe. Bake it at a Chef's Stove from dough, eggs and tree sap.\n\nInstantly restores <color is="#ffffff">5%</color> health and grants:\n\n• <color is="#ffffff">Health Regen III</color>\n• <color is="#ffffff">Swift Feet</color>\n• <color is="#ffffff">Warm Inside</color>\n• <color is="#ffffff">Nice List Boost</color>\n\nDuration: <color is="#ffffff">10:00</color>
effect.christmas_food_speed.name = Swift Feet
effect.christmas_food_warmth.name = Warm Inside
effect.christmas_food_regen.name = Health Regen III
effect.christmas_food_favor.name = Nice List Boost

# Christmas - presents, snowballs, the two suits and the Christmas Wand.
Christmas_Present.name = Christmas Present
Christmas_Present.description = A little present wrapped in red, with a bow on top. Present Thieves drop them, and Elsie the Weaver sells them at her Christmas stall. Hold it and right-click to open it, and keep whatever is inside.\n\nOr give it away: hold it, look at a friend, at Santa or at one of his helpers, and left-click. A friend gets a better gift than you would, and Santa likes you a little more.
Christmas_Snowball.name = Snowball
Christmas_Snowball.description = A cold surprise for a friend. Throw it, and whoever it hits slows down for a moment. It never hurts. Bram the Shepherd hands them out.
Christmas_Elf_Suit.name = Elf Suit
Christmas_Elf_Suit.description = A bundle of green elf clothes, just your size. Right-click to put it on and look like one of Santa's elves for <color is="#ffffff">30:00</color>. Type /zigcostume off to take it off sooner. Elsie the Weaver gives you one for helping her.
Christmas_Santa_Suit.name = Santa Suit
Christmas_Santa_Suit.description = A bundle of red clothes with white fur trim, just your size. Right-click to put it on and look like Santa himself for <color is="#ffffff">30:00</color>. Type /zigcostume off to take it off sooner. Elsie the Weaver sells it at her Christmas stall.
Christmas_Wand.name = Christmas Wand
Christmas_Wand.description = Point it at a friend. One button turns them into one of Santa's elves, the other into a reindeer, and they can take the costume off whenever they like. Elsie the Weaver sells it at her Christmas stall once you're On the List with Santa.
Christmas_Yeti_Bait.name = Yeti Bait
Christmas_Yeti_Bait.description = A fish no Yeti can say no to. <b>Bram the Shepherd</b> in the Forgotten Temple takes one to lead you and your party into the <b>Yeti Cave</b> while Christmas runs.\n\nBram sells it at his Christmas stall once you've brought his reindeer their carrots.
Christmas_Yeti_Fur_Hood.name = Yeti Fur Hood
Christmas_Yeti_Fur_Hood.description = Thick white fur from the Yeti's own back. You take <color is="#ffffff">15%</color> less Ice damage while you wear it. The Yeti sometimes leaves one behind the first time you beat him each day.
Christmas_Yeti_Fur_Coat.name = Yeti Fur Coat
Christmas_Yeti_Fur_Coat.description = A heavy coat of the Yeti's white fur. You take <color is="#ffffff">20%</color> less Ice damage while you wear it. The Yeti sometimes leaves one behind the first time you beat him each day.
Christmas_Ornament.name = Christmas Ornament
Christmas_Ornament.description = A glass bauble for the tree. Santa gives one to everyone who helps him fill his sleigh on Christmas Eve, and each Christmas has its own. Hang it anywhere you like.
